        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724750/extras/6e1aa938f99eecfc460828e1955d0fe6.avif?t=1787151889\" width=340 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cooperation. Looting. Survival.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of a ruined galaxy, laws no longer exist. The great factions have collapsed, giving way to cosmic chaos where only cunning, strength, and cooperation can ensure survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a Void Raider, a free-roaming space scavenger ready to risk everything to seize rare resources and forgotten artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone, several enemy factions are unleashing their forces against you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutants</strong> born from uncontrolled experiments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aliens</strong> with unpredictable behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robotic security</strong>, drones, and heavily armed autonomous units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and far worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Choose your role, play as a team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player must choose a specialized role, purchasable in-game. Cooperate smartly to maximize your chances of survival:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bandit</strong>: armed with a pistol, the group’s strike force, ready to engage in combat at the first sign of threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigator</strong>: equipped with a scanner, detects enemies, important objects, and traps before it’s too late.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carrier</strong>: able to lift heavy objects with less penalty, essential for recovering bulky treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hacker</strong>: can hack systems, disable machines, and open doors requiring access cards or codes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or choose to remain a Raider</strong>: versatile, it has no special abilities but benefits from <strong>an additional inventory slot</strong>, ideal for carrying more resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each role complements the others. Victory belongs to teams that communicate, adapt, and support each other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Main Mode: Expeditions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart of the game.<br>Explore, search, and loot hostile environments to bring back <strong>resources</strong>, <strong>valuable items</strong>, and <strong>rare artifacts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you extract can be sold to purchase:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >better equipment,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >character upgrades,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>robots </strong>that allow dead players to<strong> continue playing</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a mule to carry more loot,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and many other essential upgrades for survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher the difficulty, the more valuable the rewards.<br>New <strong>items</strong>, <strong>rooms</strong>, <strong>enemies</strong>, and even a <strong>hidden high-level quest</strong> await the most daring players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Defense Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mission where your team must protect an objective against waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing it reduces the maximum quota required to continue your expeditions, easing your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Breach Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short but extremely difficult mission set in an unstable environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does not count toward the quota, making it a great opportunity to take risks without harming your overall progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for earning a lot of money quickly especially if you manage to find the map’s treasure chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels <strong>except Defense Mode</strong> are <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, ensuring a fresh experience on every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Death, Permadeath &amp; Save Reset</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In all game modes Expeditions, Breach, and Defense the rule is the same:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the entire team dies, the run ends instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your expedition progress, carried resources, and completed objectives are lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your save is reset, forcing you to start again from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plan, Survive, Make It Back Alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan as a team</strong>: Up to 4 players can cooperate in the raid. Coordinate and survive together or not at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But beware</strong>: every expedition is a risk. If you fall, you lose everything… unless your teammates manage to make it out.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724750/extras/6e1aa938f99eecfc460828e1955d0fe6.avif?t=1787151889\" width=340 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cooperation. Looting. Survival.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of a ruined galaxy, laws no longer exist. The great factions have collapsed, giving way to cosmic chaos where only cunning, strength, and cooperation can ensure survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a Void Raider, a free-roaming space scavenger ready to risk everything to seize rare resources and forgotten artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone, several enemy factions are unleashing their forces against you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutants</strong> born from uncontrolled experiments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aliens</strong> with unpredictable behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robotic security</strong>, drones, and heavily armed autonomous units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and far worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Choose your role, play as a team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player must choose a specialized role, purchasable in-game. Cooperate smartly to maximize your chances of survival:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bandit</strong>: armed with a pistol, the group’s strike force, ready to engage in combat at the first sign of threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigator</strong>: equipped with a scanner, detects enemies, important objects, and traps before it’s too late.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carrier</strong>: able to lift heavy objects with less penalty, essential for recovering bulky treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hacker</strong>: can hack systems, disable machines, and open doors requiring access cards or codes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or choose to remain a Raider</strong>: versatile, it has no special abilities but benefits from <strong>an additional inventory slot</strong>, ideal for carrying more resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each role complements the others. Victory belongs to teams that communicate, adapt, and support each other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Main Mode: Expeditions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart of the game.<br>Explore, search, and loot hostile environments to bring back <strong>resources</strong>, <strong>valuable items</strong>, and <strong>rare artifacts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you extract can be sold to purchase:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >better equipment,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >character upgrades,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>robots </strong>that allow dead players to<strong> continue playing</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a mule to carry more loot,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and many other essential upgrades for survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher the difficulty, the more valuable the rewards.<br>New <strong>items</strong>, <strong>rooms</strong>, <strong>enemies</strong>, and even a <strong>hidden high-level quest</strong> await the most daring players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Defense Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mission where your team must protect an objective against waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing it reduces the maximum quota required to continue your expeditions, easing your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Breach Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short but extremely difficult mission set in an unstable environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does not count toward the quota, making it a great opportunity to take risks without harming your overall progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for earning a lot of money quickly especially if you manage to find the map’s treasure chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels <strong>except Defense Mode</strong> are <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, ensuring a fresh experience on every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Death, Permadeath &amp; Save Reset</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In all game modes Expeditions, Breach, and Defense the rule is the same:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the entire team dies, the run ends instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your expedition progress, carried resources, and completed objectives are lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your save is reset, forcing you to start again from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plan, Survive, Make It Back Alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan as a team</strong>: Up to 4 players can cooperate in the raid. Coordinate and survive together or not at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But beware</strong>: every expedition is a risk. If you fall, you lose everything… unless your teammates manage to make it out.</p>",
